    {
      "id": "reinforced-carbon-sheet-20261117",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 310,
      "text": "Reinforced Carbon Sheet | 2026-11-17\nImplemented in server KubeJS; pending /reload and runtime verification.\nMI Electric Mixer: 4 Carbon Fibre Strands + 2 Deathworm Chitin (red, yellow, or white) + 2,000 mB Naphtha (#c:naphtha) -> 4 Reinforced Carbon Sheets.\n32 EU/t, 240 ticks (12 seconds base duration).\nReplaces oritech:refinery/carbonsheet.\nRecipe: 144craft2:oritech/reinforced_carbon_sheet.\nAffects downstream sheet uses, including Advanced Machine Frames and Ultimate Control Circuits."
    },
    {
      "id": "centrifuge-alt-20261117",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 750,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "Centrifuge | 2026-11-17\nRemoved oritech:crafting/centrifugealt in server KubeJS. Other centrifuge recipes remain unchanged.\nPending /reload and runtime verification."
    },
    {
      "id": "shale-oil-jei-20261117",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "Shale Oil\nMI Shale Oil fluid and bucket hidden from JEI through oil_recipes.js. Removed all four Shale Oil distillery/distillation recipes (full, 0, 1, 2). Shared output fluids remain available through other routes. Applied locally and on the remote server; pending reload and in-game verification."
    },
    {
      "id": "recipe-adjustments-20261117",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Oil and Circuits | 2026-11-17\nMI oil processing now uses TFMG Crude Oil. Distillery recipes: 1,000 mB input; 400 ticks, 12 EU/t; outputs 350 mB Sulfuric Light Fuel, 100 mB Sulfuric Heavy Fuel, or 200 mB Sulfuric Naphtha. Tower: 1,000 mB input; 200 ticks, 36 EU/t; outputs 350/100/300 mB respectively plus 50 mB Helium.\nCircuit Assembler Casing uses 2 Carbon Large Plates, 2 Reinforced Carbon Sheets, and a Mekanism Steel Casing. Elite Circuit adds 2 sheets; Ultimate Circuit uses 4 sheets.\nImplemented on server and client/singleplayer. Pending reload and runtime verification.",
      "x": 1450,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 340
    },
    {
      "id": "electrum-alloy-smelter-20261117",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Electrum Ingot x3\nMI Electric Alloy Smelter (Extended Industrialization): 3 Gold Ingots + 1 Silver Ingot -> 3 AllTheOres Electrum Ingots.\n32 EU/t, 200 ticks (10 seconds base).\nAdditional route; vat and casting remain available. Implemented on server and client/singleplayer; pending reload and runtime verification.",
      "x": 2300,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "mi-conveyor-electrum-20261117",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "MI Conveyor\nCrafting Table or MI Assembler: 2 Motors + 6 Rubber Sheets + 1 Electrum Cable.\nReplaces Tin Cable with Electrum Cable in both conveyor recipes. MI Assembler keeps its original conveyors and other components; Electrum is required through the conveyors.\nImplemented on server and client/singleplayer; pending reload and runtime verification.",
      "x": 3000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 260
    },
